Package: agentos-runtime
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), systemd, adduser, init-system-helpers (>= 1.18~)
Maintainer: AgentOS contributors <https://github.com/eason4kim-rocket/agent-os>
Homepage: https://github.com/eason4kim-rocket/agent-os
Description: AgentOS runtime — policy-enforced exec + signed ledger for AI agents
 Resident daemon (agentd) that executes commands inside a Landlock/seccomp
 policy cage on behalf of AI agents, records every action to a signed
 hash-chain ledger, and exposes a minimal control client (agentctl).
 .
 This package ships the kernel-native Landlock enforcement backend
 (llrun), the daemon, the control client, and a ledger verification tool.
 Policies live under /var/lib/agentos/policies/ (root-owned, daemon
 read-only — the daemon cannot self-grant permissions) and are referenced
 BY NAME by clients. libc6 floor should match the oldest target the
 package is built for.
